0..71 Comment "//! `doc-comments` resolves links in doc comments and `doc` attributes."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..152 Comment "//! A link names a declaration or a footer target. The source refuses a link"
153..182 Comment "//! that resolves to neither."
183..186 Comment "//!"
187..263 Comment "//! The checker resolves each link in its source. It reads footer targets at"
264..337 Comment "//! the end of their comment run. The links follow the intra-doc links of"
338..350 Comment "//! rustdoc."
351..354 Comment "//!"
355..400 Comment "//! - see: https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustdoc/"
